    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Yatoon Booking provides a clean multi-step booking flow, customer self-service, waitlist recovery, Text Us fallback, cancellation/no-show policy display, and admin customer history.</p>\n<h3>Shortcodes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[yatoon_booking] &#8211; booking form.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_customer_portal] &#8211; customer appointment portal.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_manage_booking] &#8211; secure manage booking page.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_service_menu] &#8211; public service menu.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>5.3.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Switched remaining Plugin Check warning files to explicit file-level ignores.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Normalized PHP line endings in checked files.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.3.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Cleaned the remaining Plugin Check warning report rules.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Kept Plugin Check comments hidden inside PHP so admin pages stay clean.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.3.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Prevented Plugin Check comments from appearing in admin pages.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Cleaned the latest Plugin Check error report rules.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.3.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Changed: Free version now allows unlimited services.</li>\n<li>Kept: Free version allows up to 2 staff members.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Cleaned WordPress.org Plugin Check findings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.3.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: WordPress.org free package now hard-locks Pro pages and Pro AJAX actions.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Free package can no longer activate Pro features through Freemius license state.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Restored free limit for staff.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Changed: WordPress.org free package now excludes Pro-only integration code.</li>\n<li>Changed: Upgrade screens now point to the separate Pro version instead of offering in-package license unlocking.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Mobile-friendly appointment booking for salons, spas, and service businesses. Advanced integrations are available in the separate Pro version.",
    "description": "<p>Yatoon Booking provides a clean multi-step booking flow, customer self-service, waitlist recovery, Text Us fallback, cancellation/no-show policy display, and admin customer history.</p>\n<h3>Shortcodes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[yatoon_booking] &#8211; booking form.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_customer_portal] &#8211; customer appointment portal.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_manage_booking] &#8211; secure manage booking page.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_service_menu] &#8211; public service menu.</li>\n</ul>\n",
